  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Finacial audit Hanns R. Neumann Stiftung</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiell revision Hanns R. Neumannstiftelsen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An ordinary control routine to review the internal control system of Hanns R. Neumann Stiftung as they are proposed to implement two projects. The review will assess systems and routines for delivering development results as well as financial systems, a consultant is called-off from Sida&apos;s framework agreement for the review and to recommend improvements for the organisation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hanns R. Neumann Stiftung &#xE4;r f&#xF6;reslagna att implementera tv&#xE5; projekt. D&#xE4;rf&#xF6;r best&#xE4;ller Sida en rutinkontroll av organisationens interna styrning och kontroll. Konsulter avropas som kommer att unders&#xF6;ka de finansiella styrsystemen, samt system f&#xF6;r att leverera utvecklingsresultat. Rekommendationer p&#xE5; f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttringar f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;s till Sida och organisationen.</narrative>
  </description>
